<title>USA: Samsung clears hurdle in AST tender.</title>
<headline>Samsung clears hurdle in AST tender.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsung Electronics Co Ltd on Monday said it was granted early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act in connection with its tender offer for AST Research Inc.</p>
<p>Samsung is offering to buy all the AST shares it does not own for $5.40 per share.</p>
<p>The tender offer is set to expire May 19, Samsung said.</p>
